{title: God of Our Fathers}
{artist: Daniel Roberts & George Warren}
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[Eb]God of our fathers, [Bb]whose al[Cm]mighty [Ab]hand
[Eb]leads forth in beauty [Bb]all the [Cm]starry [Bb]band
of [Eb]shining worlds in [Ab]splendor [Bb]through the [Cm]skies —
our [Eb]grateful songs be[Bb]fore thy [Eb]throne a[Bb]rise.
